{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"日テレハロウィン2016\n今年は天使と悪魔でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/01/7409384/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"細部までこだわるゴシックで\nドレッシーなお衣装に網タイツとマーチン。\n毎度毎度素晴らしくて眺めるのも楽しいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/01/7409384/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天使まいちゅん(°▽°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/01/7409384/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イクタリアン(°▽°)\n衣装のレースとかがよく分かる写真。\nわかりにくいけど目元の色が赤とか紫で！\n新しく買ったコスメでやった〜\n赤紫ってほんと好きだ！！\n特に好きな色だ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ありがとうございました。\n体調のご心配おかけしました、\nとても元気です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/01/7409384/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身ラメラメとパイソン柄。\nこの無重力イヤリング使い方分かってきた！\nネックレス重たい！\n慢性肩こり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/11/01/7409384/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三つ編みしてワンピースも着た！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"総じてスケスケ(°▽°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真多いけど、なんとか5枚に納めたよ！\n終わったけどハッピーハロウィン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}